    "| 5. Measurement diagnostics | 3.2 (Figure 6) |\n",
    "| 6. Exposure and dissatisfaction models | 3.3, 3.4 (Equations 1–2, Figures 3–4) |\n",
    "| 7. Same-source assessment | 3.6 |\n",
    "| 8. Robustness and heterogeneity | 2.6, 3.5 (Figure 5) |\n",
    "| 9. Constructs not supported | 3.7 |\n",
    "| 10. Exports | — |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Runtime:** approximately three to five minutes on a standard laptop."
