      "\n",
      "### Equation (2) — dissatisfaction with interaction   n=51,037  clusters=11,500  pseudo-R2=0.086\n",
      "                             OR   CI_low  CI_high       p\n",
      "mass_market              0.8787   0.7960   0.9700  0.0103\n",
