      "\n",
      "### Leave-one-out provider-level indicators   n=50,178  clusters=10,641  pseudo-R2=0.085\n",
      "                   OR   CI_low   CI_high       p\n",
      "coord_loo      0.0688   0.0459    0.1030  0.0000\n",
